Note, a chat server built on websockets.
Note, start it, then open localhost 8093 in two browser tabs.
Note, run this from the project folder so that the page is found.

Define show page that takes request, do the following.
Read the file examples slash chat.html and store it in page.
Set content type to html.
Respond with the value of page.
End define.

Define handle chat that takes connection, do the following.
Say Someone said something.
Say the value of message.
Broadcast the value of message to all connections.
End define.

Add route GET slash to show page.
Add websocket route slash chat to handle chat.

Start a webserver on port 8093.
Say Open localhost 8093 in two browser tabs.
Wait for connections.
